his round and report every finding you can establish, not only the first; say in `sweep` what you swept. A draft that leaves a finding above unaccounted, or states no sweep, is invalid and is never taken as an approval.\")\n873:\t\t\tfor _, p := range draft.PriorFindings {","numLines":8,"totalLines":8},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01VeaPa1XPxdtAvqiXz438U3","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
